  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Hugo Mann was a German retail entrepreneur who founded the Wertkauf hypermarket chain and Mann Mobilia furniture stores. From Karlsruhe, he built businesses that helped popularise large self-service shopping centres. He later sold both chains, while he and his family retained a substantial American property portfolio managed through Sunbelt Management.",
